{"ref":"BDB, אֲדָר","hw":"אֲדָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדָר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] 12th (Babylonian) month = Mar.–Apr. <strong>(</strong>late Heb. loan-word, = Bab. <em>A(d)-daru</em> v. Dl<sup>W p. 188, cf. Al3 93</sup>, meaning dub. perhaps <em>adâru</em>, be darkened, <em>eclipsed</em>, but v. Dl<sup>W p. 190</sup><strong>)</strong> <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:7\" href=\"/Esther.3.7\">Est 3:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:13\" href=\"/Esther.3.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:12\" href=\"/Esther.8.12\">8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:1\" href=\"/Esther.9.1\">9:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:15\" href=\"/Esther.9.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:17\" href=\"/Esther.9.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:19\" href=\"/Esther.9.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:21\" href=\"/Esther.9.21\">21</a>; cf. Palm. Nab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אדר</span> Vog<sup>8</sup> Eut<sup>Nab 24</sup>.","next":"BDB, אַדְרַמֶּ֫לֶךְ","prev":"BDB, אַדֶּ֫רֶת"}